# Lesson 5 / 6 export artefacts.  Regenerate them with
#   python3 joy/tests/python_tests/test_lesson5.py
#
# These files can be very large for the full Qwen3-0.6B model, so we
# keep them out of git by default.  The single exception is the
# teaching-scale `qwen3_tiny.onnx` (~3 MB) which is small enough to
# version directly -- it lets a new clone open Netron and inspect the
# expected ONNX layout without first running the export pipeline.
*.onnx
*.onnx_data
*.weights
*.proto
!.gitignore
!qwen3_tiny.onnx
